   "The repair was hidden beneath a coating. Confirming the full price rewarded a misleading sale.",
   "The join was plain to experienced buyers and was named before purchase. Cancellation ignored an informed bargain.",
   "Cite a mastered Nezikin work and test the sale's description.",
   "Mishnah Bava Metzia 4:11 addresses defects in sales. The court still needs to inspect this pearl and hear what was said.",
